                <note rend="inline" type="source">893.512/639: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        the Chargé in China</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Mayer</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1927-08-19T16:00:00-04:00"><hi rendition="#italic">August 19,
                                1927—4 p.m.</hi></date></dateline></opener>
                <p>320. Your 819, August 19, 1 p.m. Department approves your reply to Shanghai as
                    set forth in paragraph 2.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Kellogg</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
